ertherapeutics.com/pipeline-overview/?popup=alzheimers)\n\n[• APOE Gene Therapy for Alzheimer’s](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/pipeline-overview/?popup=apoe)\n\n[Patient Resources](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/patient-resources/)\n\n[Partnerships](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/science-partnerships/)\n\nSCIENCE\n\n[Overview](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/science-overview/)\n\n[TRACER Platform](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/science-tracer/)\n\n[Non-Viral Approaches](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/science-non-viral/)\n\n[Publications & Presentations](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/science-publications/)\n\n[Partnerships](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/science-partnerships/)\n\nINVESTORS\n\n[Overview](https://ir.voyagertherapeutics.com/)\n\n[Press Releases](https://ir.voyagertherapeutics.com/press-releases)\n\n[Events & Presentations](https://ir.voyagertherapeutics.com/events-presentations)\n\n[Corporate Governance](https://ir.voyagertherapeutics.com/corporate-governance/committee-composition)\n\n[Financials](https://ir.voyagertherapeutics.com/financial-information/sec-filings)\n\n[Stock Information](https://ir.voyagertherapeutics.com/stock-information/stock-quote)\n\n[Shareholder Services](https://ir.voyagertherapeutics.com/shareholder-services/investor-faqs)\n\nCAREERS\n\n[Overview](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/careers-overview/)\n\n[Job Openings](https://boards.greenhouse.io/voyagertherapeutics/)\n\n[Our Community](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/careers-culture/)\n\n[Core Values](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/about-core-values/)\n\n[Benefits](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/careers-benefits/)\n\n[Disclosures](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/careers-disclosures/)\n\n##### ABOUT\n\n[Overview](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/about-overview/)\n\n[Vision, Mission, & Strategy](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/about-vision-mission-strategy/)\n\n[Management Team](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/about-leadership/#managementteam)\n\n[Board of Directors](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/about-leadership/#bod)\n\n[Core Values](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/about-core-values/)\n\n##### PIPELINE\n\n[Overview](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/pipeline-overview/)\n\n[• VY7523 for Alzheimer’s](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/pipeline-overview/?popup=vy7523)\n\n[• VY1706 for Alzheimer’s](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/pipeline-overview/?popup=alzheimers)\n\n[• APOE Gene Therapy for Alzheimer’s](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/pipeline-overview/?popup=apoe)\n\n[Patient Resources](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/patient-resources/)\n\n[Partnerships](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/science-partnerships/)\n\n##### SCIENCE\n\n[Overview](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/science-overview/)\n\n[TRACER Platform](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/science-tracer/)\n\n[Non-Viral Approaches](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/science-non-viral/)\n\n[Publications & Presentations](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/science-publications/)\n\n[Partnerships](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/science-partnerships/)\n\n##### INVESTORS\n\n[Overview](https://ir.voyagertherapeutics.com/)\n\n[Press Releases](https://ir.voyagertherapeutics.com/press-releases)\n\n[Events & Presentations](https://ir.voyagertherapeutics.com/events-presentations)\n\n[Corporate Governance](https://ir.voyagertherapeutics.com/corporate-governance/committee-composition)\n\n[Financials](https://ir.voyagertherapeutics.com/financial-information/sec-filings)\n\n[Stock Information](https://ir.voyagertherapeutics.com/stock-information/stock-quote)\n\n[Shareholder Services](https://ir.voyagertherapeutics.com/shareholder-services/investor-faqs)\n\n##### CAREERS\n\n[Overview](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/careers-overview/)\n\n[Job Openings](https://boards.greenhouse.io/voyagertherapeutics/)\n\n[Our Community](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/careers-culture/)\n\n[Core Values](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/about-core-values/)\n\n[Benefits](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/careers-benefits/)\n\n[Disclosures](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/careers-disclosures/)\n\nSearch for:     \n\n# Pipeline\n\n### Advancing transformative medicines  \nfor neurological diseases.\n\n## Neurologic diseases – which are estimated to impact more than 1 billion people globally – represent a significant burden on those who suffer from them, on their families and communities, and on the healthcare system.\n\nThanks to significant advances in human genetics and genomics, we now understand the molecular causes of many neurological diseases and know how to target them.\n\nOur pipeline includes medicines targeting the genetics underlying multiple neurological diseases.\n\nMECHANISM / INDICATION\n\nResearch\n\nIND-Enabling\n\nPhase I/II\n\nPivotal\n\nApproved\n\nWHOLLY-OWNED PIPELINE\n\n**+ VY7523 (Anti-tau Antibody)** / Alzheimer’s Disease\n\n**+ VY1706 (Tau Silencing Gene Therapy)** (siRNA) / Alzheimer’s Disease\n\n**ALPL-VYGR-NeuroShuttle** / Undisclosed\n\nMECHANISM / INDICATION\n\nResearch\n\nIND-Enabling\n\nPhase I/II\n\nPivotal\n\nApproved\n\nOPT-IN RIGHTS\n\n**NBIB-‘223 (FXN Gene Therapy)** / Friedreich’s Ataxia  \n*Neurocrine (VYGR has option for 40% US rights)*\n\n**GBA1 Gene Therapy** / Gaucher Disease / Parkinson’s Disease  \n*Neurocrine (VYGR has option for 50% US rights)*\n\n**TDP-43 Small Molecule**  / ALS / FTD  \n*Transition Bio (VYGR has option for 100% WW rights)*\n\nLICENSES & COLLABORATIONS\n\n**Three Gene Therapies**  / Undisclosed  \n*Neurocrine  \n*\n\n*2 in IND-enabling; 1 undisclosed*\n\n**Three Gene Therapies**  / HD, SMA, Undisclosed  \n*Novartis  \n*\n\n*Undisclosed*\n\n**One Gene Therapy**  / Undisclosed  \n*Alexion  \n*\n\n*Undisclosed*\n\nOne of the most significant challenges in neurotherapeutics remains developing medicines that can cross the blood-brain barrier and hit their targets. To address this problem, Voyager has discovered novel capsids and identified associated receptors that potentially enable exceptional delivery across the blood-brain barrier following intravenous dosing.\n\n[![Read About Targeting Tau in Alzheimer's in BioCentury](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Biocentury_TargetingTau_thumb_web.png \"Biocentury_TargetingTau_thumb_web\")](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/BioCentury_Tau_2024.pdf)\n\n## Patient Resources\n\nOne of Voyager’s core values is “Patients First.” This means we act with urgency and drive every decision with the knowledge that patients are waiting for us.\n\n[Patient Resources](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/patient-resources/)\n\n*Photo: Klaus C., living with ALS, 2023*\n\n## Partners\n\nOur allies in realizing the potential of neurogenetic medicines\n\n![](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Partner_Logo_White_Alexion.png \"Partner_Logo_White_Alexion\")\n\n![](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Partner_Logo_White_Neurocrine.png \"Partner_Logo_White_Neurocrine\")\n\n![](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Partner_Logo_White_Novartis.png \"Partner_Logo_White_Novartis\")\n\n[Learn More](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/science-partnerships/)\n\n## VY7523\n\n### anti-tau antibody for Alzheimer’s disease\n\n**Indication**: [Alzheimer’s disease](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/patient-resources/#alzheimers)\n\n**Modality**: monoclonal antibody\n\n**Target**: tau protein. Designed to target unique C-terminal epitope and block the spread of pathological tau, which is closely correlated with disease progression and cognitive decline in Alzheimer’s disease (AD).\n\n**Key Data**: At [AAIC 2022](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/14_new_POSTER-Voyager_AAIC2022_Liu_tauAb_FINAL.pdf), Voyager presented data demonstrating that an anti-tau antibody delivered intravenously inhibited the spread of pathological tau by >70% in a mouse seeding model. In a single ascending dose study in healthy volunteers, data on VY7523 demonstrated safety, tolerability, and dose-proportional pharmacokinetics as presented at [CTAD 2025](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Final_CTAD25_Ratti_Elena_VoyagerTherapeutics.pdf). Also at CTAD 2025, Voyager presented the [study design of the multiple ascending dose intravenous dose study](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Final_POSTER-Voyager_CTAD_Butler_November_2025.pdf).\n\n**Status**: Voyager expects tau positron emission tomography (PET) imaging efficacy data in Q4 2026 from the ongoing multiple ascending dose (MAD) clinical trial in participants with Alzheimer’s disease.\n\n## VY1706\n\n### tau silencing gene therapy program\n\n**Indication**: [Alzheimer’s disease](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/patient-resources/#alzheimers)\n\n**Modality**: gene therapy: novel TRACER-derived capsid with vectorized anti-tau siRNA\n\n**Target**: intracellular tau\n\n**Key Data**: At [AAIC 2026](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/science-publications/), Voyager presented 6-month good laboratory practice (GLP) toxicology non-human primate (NHP) data showing VY1706 was well tolerated and resulted in sustained tau protein reduction by up to 75% in key AD brain regions following a single intravenous (IV) dose.\n\n**Status**: Expected to begin dosing in adults with early AD in Q4 2026. [ClinicalTrials.gov](https://clinicaltrials.gov/study/NCT07764146?cond=alzheimer%27s%20disease&viewType=Card&term=VY1706&rank=1)\n\n[![](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Voyager_logo_web.png \"Voyager_logo_web\")](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/)\n\nVoyager Therapeutics, Inc.   •   75 Hayden Avenue, Lexington, MA 02421   •   857.259.5340    [![linkedin](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/voyager_icon_linkedin.png)](https://www.linkedin.com/company/voyager-therapeutics-inc-/ \"linkedin\")\n\n© 2026 Voyager Therapeutics, Inc. All rights reserved.   /   [Terms of Use](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/terms-of-use/)   /   [Privacy Policy](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/privacy-policy/)   /   Site by [D&CO](https://designandco.net/)\n\n[![](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Voyager_logo_web.png \"Voyager_logo_web\")](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/)\n\nVoyager Therapeutics, Inc.  \n75 Hayden Avenue  \nLexington, MA 02421  \n857.259.5340[](https://www.linkedin.com/company/voyager-therapeutics-inc-/ \"linkedin\")\n\n[![linkedin](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/voyager_icon_linkedin.png)](https://www.linkedin.com/company/voyager-therapeutics-inc-/ \"linkedin\")\n\n© 2026 Voyager Therapeutics, Inc., All rights reserved.  \n[Terms of Use](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/terms-of-use/)   /   [Privacy Policy](https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/privacy-policy/)   /   Site by [D&CO](https://designandco.net/)","metadata":{"truncated":false},"title":"https://www.voyagertherapeutics.com/pipeline-overview/ (text/html; charset=UTF-8)","time":{"start":1792551755452,"end":1792551756278}},"id":"prt_15c691e3d001Mv9CvtjXODr7Pn","sessionID":"ses_ea39876d7ffe6f5aZMqB3WhOtI","messageID":"msg_15c68cba7001nk8WyOLsebHgw4"}}
